          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡತನ — baḍatana — \"poverty\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡತನದಿಂದ ಅವನು ಶಾಲೆ ಬಿಟ್ಟನು. baḍatanadinda avanu śāle biṭṭanu. He left school because of poverty."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡ (poor) + -ತನ (-ness)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಡತನ (baḍatana) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5222 lists Kannada baḍa, \"poor\", and baḍatana, \"poverty\", with the ending -tana, \"-ness\"."
            }
          ]
        },
