          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸವಲತ್ತು — savalattu — \"a privilege; a benefit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿರಿಯ ನಾಗರಿಕರಿಗೆ ಬಸ್ಸಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಕೆಲವು ಸವಲತ್ತುಗಳು ಇವೆ. hiriya nāgarikarige bassinalli kelavu savalattugaḷu ive. Senior citizens get some concessions on the bus."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಸವಲತ್ತುಗಳು, savalattugaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Often plural: ಸವಲತ್ತುಗಳು, benefits."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸವಲತ್ತು (savalattu) is usually traced to Arabic suhūlat, \"ease, convenience\", which reached Kannada through Hindustani and Marathi."
            }
          ]
        },
