          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿತರಿಸು (vitarisu) is built on Sanskrit vitaraṇa, \"granting, bestowal, gift\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
